<section id="A3" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix C </span>Agent Framework</h2>

<div id="A3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Presentation creation requires interacting with heterogeneous resources beyond static web text, including search results, images, papers, and local files, as well as inspecting intermediate artifacts such as manuscripts and rendered slides. To support this, we organize our toolset into five categories (Table <a href="#A2.T8" title="Table 8 ‣ B.3 Evaluation Set ‣ Appendix B Dataset ‣ DeepPresenter: Environment-Grounded Reflection for Agentic Presentation Generation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a>): <span id="A3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Retrieve</span> for information gathering, <span id="A3.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">File</span> for document manipulation, <span id="A3.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Reason</span> for inspection and reflection, <span id="A3.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Control</span> for task management, and <span id="A3.p1.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Synthesis</span> for code execution and asset generation.</p>
</div>
<section id="A3.SS0.SSS0.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Inspection Tools.</h4>

<div id="A3.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The <span id="A3.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Reason</span> category includes two inspection tools that enable environment-grounded reflection:</p>
<ul id="A3.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A3.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A3.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.I1.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">inspect_manuscript</span>: Parses the markdown manuscript and returns structured diagnostics, including the total slide count, detected content language, and validation results for referenced image assets. The tool checks whether each image path exists, flags external URLs that should be downloaded locally, identifies missing alt text, and warns about duplicate image usage.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A3.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A3.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.I1.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">inspect_slide</span>: Renders an HTML slide into a pixel image using a headless browser and returns the image to the agent’s visual context. The tool supports multiple aspect ratios (16:9 widescreen, 4:3 standard, A1 poster) and enables agents to perceive visual defects such as contrast issues and element overflow that are invisible at the code level.</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
<div id="A3.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p2.1" class="ltx_p">Each task is executed as a sequence of reasoning-action-observation steps within a maximum context window of 50K tokens. To prevent context overflow, our system sends warning messages when the accumulated window length reaches 50% and 80% of the maximum capacity, allowing the agent to adjust its strategy accordingly.</p>
</div>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A4" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix D </span>Prompts</h2>

<section id="A4.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">D.1 </span>Data Synthesis Prompts</h3>

<div id="A4.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A4.SS1.p1.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="112.97" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 653.15 112.97" width="653.15"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,112.97) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#0000BF;" fill="#0000BF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 5.91 L 0 107.06 C 0 110.32 2.64 112.97 5.91 112.97 L 647.24 112.97 C 650.51 112.97 653.15 110.32 653.15 107.06 L 653.15 5.91 C 653.15 2.64 650.51 0 647.24 0 L 5.91 0 C 2.64 0 0 2.64 0 5.91 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F2F2FF;" fill="#F2F2FF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 5.91 L 1.97 87.32 L 651.18 87.32 L 651.18 5.91 C 651.18 3.73 649.42 1.97 647.24 1.97 L 5.91 1.97 C 3.73 1.97 1.97 3.73 1.97 5.91 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 96.68)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:44.07em;--ltx-fo-height:0.75em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.25em;font-size:10pt;" height="13.84" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 10.38)" width="609.8"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
